#: org.kde.kdenetwork-filesharing.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "Samba Filesharing Plugin"
msgstr "Complemento de compartición de ficheiros de Samba"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: org.kde.kdenetwork-filesharing.metainfo.xml:8
msgid "Adds Configuration of Samba sharing for folders in Dolphin"
msgstr "Engade configuración de compartición de Samba de cartafoles en Dolphin"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: org.kde.kdenetwork-filesharing.metainfo.xml:10
msgid ""
"With this plugin you can set your folders to be shared on your local network u"
"sing Samba, which talks the SMB protocol common on Windows and other platforms"
"."
msgstr ""
"Con este complemento pode definir os seus cartafoles para que se compartan na "
"súa rede local usando Samba, que se comunica usando o protocolo SMB común en W"
"indows e outras plataformas."
